    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let an interval elapse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμμετρον ἐπιδιαστήσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιίσταμαι</span>
			<i>have a second</i>
			<i>diastole</i>, of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Syn.Puls.</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αμένων τῶν βραχιόνων</span>
			<i>getting more separated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.62
			</span></i>.</div>
